 quality',0,41),(56,'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1508061253366-f7da158b6d46?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop','Mixed Dry Fruit Gift Box — fresh, premium quality',0,42),(57,'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1596040033229-a9821ebd058d?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop','Mixed Dry Fruit Gift Box — fresh, premium quality',1,42),(59,'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1592924357228-91a4daadcfea?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop','Vine-Ripened Tomatoes — fresh, premium quality',0,1),(60,'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1561136594-7f68413baa99?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop','Vine-Ripened Tomatoes — fresh, premium quality',1,1);
/*!40000 ALTER TABLE `product_images` ENABLE KEYS */;
UNLOCK TABLES;
DROP TABLE IF EXISTS `products`;
/*!40101 SET @saved_cs_client     = @@character_set_client */;
/*!50503 SET character_set_client = utf8mb4 */;
CREATE TABLE `products` (
  `id` int unsigned NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,
  `name` varchar(191) COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci NOT NULL,
  `slug` varchar(191) COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci NOT NULL,
  `categoryId` int unsigned NOT NULL,
  `description` text COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci NOT NULL,
  `shortDescription` text COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci NOT NULL,
  `price` double NOT NULL,
  `discountPrice` double DEFAULT NULL,
  `unit` varchar(50) COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci NOT NULL DEFAULT 'Kg',
  `weightOptions` text COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci,
  `stockStatus` enum('IN_STOCK','LOW_STOCK','OUT_OF_STOCK') COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci NOT NULL DEFAULT 'IN_STOCK',
  `isFeatured` tinyint(1) NOT NULL DEFAULT '0',
  `isPopular` tinyint(1) NOT NULL DEFAULT '0',
  `isNewArrival` tinyint(1) NOT NULL DEFAULT '0',
  `isBestSeller` tinyint(1) NOT NULL DEFAULT '0',
  `isSeasonal` tinyint(1) NOT NULL DEFAULT '0',
  `isFresh` tinyint(1) NOT NULL DEFAULT '1',
  `isOrganic` tinyint(1) NOT NULL DEFAULT '0',
  `onOffer` tinyint(1) NOT NULL DEFAULT '0',
  `nutrition` text COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci,
  `storageInstructions` text COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci,
  `origin` varchar(191) COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci DEFAULT NULL,
  `brand` varchar(191) COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci DEFAULT NULL,
  `seoTitle` varchar(255) COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci DEFAULT NULL,
  `seoDescription` text COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci,
  `metaKeywords` text COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci,
  `views` int NOT NULL DEFAULT '0',
  `createdAt` datetime DEFAULT NULL,
  `updatedAt` datetime DEFAULT NULL,
  PRIMARY KEY (`id`),
  UNIQUE KEY `slug` (`slug`),
  KEY `categoryId` (`categoryId`),
  KEY `isFeatured` (`isFeatured`),
  KEY `createdAt` (`createdAt`),
  CONSTRAINT `products_categoryId_foreign` FOREIGN KEY (`categoryId`) REFERENCES `categories` (`id`) ON DELETE RESTRICT ON UPDATE RESTRICT
) ENGINE=InnoDB AUTO_INCREMENT=43 DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COLLATE=utf8mb4_unicode_ci;
/*!40101 SET character_set_client = @saved_cs_client */;

LOCK TABLES `products` WRITE;
/*!40000 ALTER TABLE `products` DISABLE KEYS */;
INSERT INTO `products` VALUES (1,'Vine-Ripened Tomatoes','vine-ripened-tomatoes',1,'Our vine-ripened tomatoes are picked at peak maturity for maximum sweetness and that unmistakable garden aroma. Ideal for salads, sauces, and everyday cooking. Sourced daily from partner farms and quality checked before dispatch.','Juicy, deep-red tomatoes ripened naturally on the vine.',2.49,NULL,'Kg','[\"250 g\",\"500 g\",\"1 Kg\",\"2 Kg\",\"5 Kg\"]','IN_STOCK',1,0,0,1,0,1,0,0,'Per 100g: 18 kcal, Carbs 3.9g, Protein 0.9g, Fat 0.2g, Vitamin C 21% DV, Potassium 237mg','Store at room temperature away from direct sunlight. Refrigerate only when fully ripe.','Local partner farms',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,820,'2026-07-15 14:33:53','2026-07-15 14:59:27'),(2,'Broccoli Crowns','broccoli-crowns',1,'Crisp, nutrient-dense broccoli crowns with firm stems and compact florets. Steam, roast, or stir-fry — the flavour holds beautifully. Harvested and chilled within hours.','Tight, deep-green crowns cut fresh every morning.',3.29,2.79,'Kg','[\"500 g\",\"1 Kg\",\"2 Kg\"]','IN_STOCK',0,1,0,0,0,1,0,1,'Per 100g: 34 kcal, Carbs 6.6g, Protein 2.8g, Fat 0.4g, Vitamin C 148% DV, Vitamin K 127% DV','Refrigerate unwashed in a perforated bag. Best within 4 days.','Highland farms',NULL,'Broccoli Crowns — Fresh Kg Price | FreshMart','Tight, deep-green crowns cut fresh every morning.','broccoli crowns, fresh vegetables, wholesale, retail',751,'2026-07-15 14:33:53','2026-07-15 14:33:53'),(3,'Organic Carrots','organic-carrots',3,'Certified organic carrots with a naturally sweet bite. Perfect for juicing, roasting, or snacking. Grown in mineral-rich soil and hand-sorted for uniform quality.','Sweet, crunchy carrots grown without synthetic inputs.',1.99,NULL,'Kg','[\"250 g\",\"500 g\",\"1 Kg\",\"2 Kg\",\"5 Kg\"]','IN_STOCK',0,1,0,1,0,1,1,0,'Per 100g: 41 kcal, Carbs 9.6g, Protein 0.9g, Fat 0.2g, Vitamin A 334% DV','Remove tops and refrigerate in a sealed bag for up to 3 weeks.','Certified organic farms',NULL,'Organic Carrots — Fresh Kg Price | FreshMart','Sweet, crunchy carrots grown without synthetic inputs.','organic carrots, fresh root vegetables, wholesale, retail',430,'2026-07-15 14:33:53','2026-07-15 14:33:53'),(4,'Baby Spinach','baby-spinach',2,'Delicate baby spinach picked young for tenderness. Triple-washed and packed cold, it goes straight from bag to bowl. A salad and smoothie essential.','Tender baby spinach leaves, triple-washed and ready.',2.79,NULL,'Pack','[\"200 g Pack\",\"500 g Pack\",\"1 Kg Box\"]','IN_STOCK',1,0,0,0,0,1,1,0,'Per 100g: 23 kcal, Carbs 3.6g, Protein 2.9g, Fat 0.4g, Iron 15% DV, Folate 49% DV','Keep refrigerated at 1–4°C. Consume within 3 days of opening.','Hydroponic greenhouse',NULL,'Baby Spinach — Fresh Pack Price | FreshMart','Tender baby spinach leaves, triple-washed and ready.','baby spinach, fresh leafy vegetables, wholesale, retail',113,'2026-07-15 14:33:53','2026-07-15 14:33:53'),(5,'Curly Kale','curly-kale',2,'Deep-green curly kale with a hearty texture that stands up to sautéing, baking into chips, or massaging into salads. A true superfood staple.','Robust curly kale bunches bursting with nutrients.',2.49,NULL,'Bundle','[]','IN_STOCK',0,0,1,0,0,1,1,0,'Per 100g: 35 kcal, Carbs 4.4g, Protein 2.9g, Fat 1.5g, Vitamin K 390% DV, Vitamin C 120% DV','Wrap in damp paper towel and refrigerate. Use within 5 days.','Local organic farms',NULL,'Curly Kale — Fresh Bundle Price | FreshMart','Robust curly kale bunches bursting with nutrients.','curly kale, fresh leafy vegetables, wholesale, retail',190,'2026-07-15 14:33:53','2026-07-15 14:33:53'),(6,'Russet Potatoes','russet-potatoes',3,'Classic russet potatoes with a high-starch flesh that bakes fluffy and fries crisp. Graded and brushed clean, available in retail and wholesale quantities.','Fluffy, versatile potatoes ideal for roasting and mash.',1.49,NULL,'Kg','[\"1 Kg\",\"2 Kg\",\"5 Kg\",\"10 Kg Sack\",\"25 Kg Sack\"]','IN_STOCK',0,1,0,0,0,1,0,0,'Per 100g: 79 kcal, Carbs 18g, Protein 2.1g, Fat 0.1g, Potassium 417mg','Store in a cool, dark, well-ventilated place. Do not refrigerate.','Valley farms',NULL,'Russet Potatoes — Fresh Kg Price | FreshMart','Fluffy, versatile potatoes ideal for roasting and mash.','russet potatoes, fresh root vegetables, wholesale, retail',699,'2026-07-15 14:33:53','2026-07-15 14:33:53'),(7,'Red Onions','red-onions',3,'Firm red onions with a balanced sharp-sweet flavour, perfect raw in salads or caramelised. Sun-cured for longer shelf life.','Sharp, sweet red onions with glossy skins.',1.79,NULL,'Kg','[\"250 g\",\"500 g\",\"1 Kg\",\"2 Kg\",\"5 Kg\"]','IN_STOCK',0,0,0,1,0,1,0,0,'Per 100g: 40 kcal, Carbs 9.3g, Protein 1.1g, Fat 0.1g, Vitamin C 12% DV','Store in a cool, dry, dark place with good airflow.','Regional farms',NULL,'Red Onions — Fresh Kg Price | FreshMart','Sharp, sweet red onions with glossy skins.','red onions, fresh root vegetables, wholesale, retail',957,'2026-07-15 14:33:53','2026-07-15 14:33:53'),(8,'Rainbow Bell Peppers','rainbow-bell-peppers',1,'Crisp, glossy bell peppers in a vibrant mixed pack. Sweet enough to eat raw, sturdy enough for grilling and stuffing. Greenhouse-grown for consistent quality year round.','A trio of red, yellow and green peppers.',4.49,3.99,'Pack','[\"3-Piece Pack\",\"6-Piece Pack\",\"5 Kg Box\"]','IN_STOCK',1,1,0,0,0,1,0,1,'Per 100g: 31 kcal, Carbs 6g, Protein 1g, Fat 0.3g, Vitamin C 213% DV','Refrigerate in crisper drawer. Best within 7 days.','Greenhouse grown',NULL,'Rainbow Bell Peppers — Fresh Pack Price | FreshMart','A trio of red, yellow and green peppers.','rainbow bell peppers, fresh vegetables, wholesale, retail',685,'2026-07-15 14:33:53','2026-07-15 14:33:53'),(9,'English Cucumbers','english-cucumbers',1,'Long English cucumbers with barely-there seeds and refreshing crunch. Individually wrapped to lock in moisture and freshness.','Cool, crisp cucumbers with thin, tender skin.',1.29,NULL,'Piece','[]','IN_STOCK',0,0,0,0,0,1,0,0,'Per 100g: 15 kcal, Carbs 3.6g, Protein 0.7g, Fat 0.1g, 95% water content','Refrigerate. Keep wrapped until use.','Greenhouse grown',NULL,'English Cucumbers — Fresh Piece Price | FreshMart','Cool, crisp cucumbers with thin, tender skin.','english cucumbers, fresh vegetables, wholesale, retail',693,'2026-07-15 14:33:53','2026-07-15 14:33:53'),(10,'Cauliflower Heads','cauliflower-heads',1,'Dense, creamy-white cauliflower heads trimmed of outer leaves. Roast whole, rice it, or blitz into a silky purée. Field-fresh and chilled promptly.','Snow-white heads with tight, heavy curds.',2.99,NULL,'Piece','[]','IN_STOCK',0,0,1,0,0,1,0,0,'Per 100g: 25 kcal, Carbs 5g, Protein 1.9g, Fat 0.3g, Vitamin C 80% DV','Refrigerate stem-side down in an open bag. Use within 5 days.','Highland farms',NULL,'Cauliflower Heads — Fresh Piece Price | FreshMart','Snow-white heads with tight, heavy curds.','cauliflower heads, fresh vegetables, wholesale, retail',429,'2026-07-15 14:33:53','2026-07-15 14:33:53'),(11,'Royal Gala Apples','royal-gala-apples',4,'Hand-picked Royal Gala apples with a fine, crisp bite and floral sweetness. Cold-stored at optimal humidity so every apple crunches like harvest day.','Crisp, honey-sweet apples with a rosy blush.',3.49,NULL,'Kg','[\"250 g\",\"500 g\",\"1 Kg\",\"2 Kg\",\"5 Kg\"]','IN_STOCK',1,0,0,1,0,1,0,0,'Per 100g: 52 kcal, Carbs 14g, Protein 0.3g, Fat 0.2g, Fiber 2.4g','Refrigerate for longest life; room temperature for best flavour.','Mountain orchards',NULL,'Royal Gala Apples — Fresh Kg Price | FreshMart','Crisp, honey-sweet apples with a rosy blush.','royal gala apples, fresh fruits, wholesale, retail',487,'2026-07-15 14:33:53','2026-07-15 14:33:53'),(12,'Cavendish Bananas','cavendish-bananas',4,'Premium Cavendish bananas ripened naturally without artificial agents. Perfect for breakfast, baking, and smoothies. Sold by the dozen or wholesale by the box.','Naturally ripened bananas, sweet and creamy.',1.59,NULL,'Dozen','[\"6 Pieces\",\"1 Dozen\",\"13 Kg Box\"]','IN_STOCK',0,1,0,1,0,1,0,0,'Per 100g: 89 kcal, Carbs 23g, Protein 1.1g, Fat 0.3g, Potassium 358mg','Store at room temperature. Refrigerate only when fully ripe.','Tropical plantations',NULL,'Cavendish Bananas — Fresh Dozen Price | FreshMart','Naturally ripened bananas, sweet and creamy.','cavendish bananas, fresh fruits, wholesale, retail',901,'2026-07-15 14:33:53','2026-07-15 14:33:53'),(13,'Valencia Oranges','valencia-oranges',4,'Thin-skinned Valencia oranges prized for their juice content and bright, balanced sweetness. Excellent for fresh juice and snacking.','Juicy oranges bursting with sunshine.',2.99,2.49,'Kg','[\"250 g\",\"500 g\",\"1 Kg\",\"2 Kg\",\"5 Kg\"]','IN_STOCK',0,1,0,0,1,1,0,1,'Per 100g: 47 kcal, Carbs 12g, Protein 0.9g, Fat 0.1g, Vitamin C 88% DV','Store at room temperature up to a week, refrigerate for longer.','Citrus groves',NULL,'Valencia Oranges — Fresh Kg Price | FreshMart','Juicy oranges bursting with sunshine.','valencia oranges, fresh fruits, wholesale, retail',142,'2026-07-15 14:33:53','2026-07-15 14:33:53'),(14,'Fresh Strawberries','fresh-strawberries',6,'Plump, aromatic strawberries harvested in the cool of the morning and rushed to you the same day. Sweetness you can smell before you taste.','Fragrant, ruby-red berries picked at dawn.',4.99,NULL,'Box','[\"250 g Punnet\",\"500 g Punnet\",\"2 Kg Tray\"]','IN_STOCK',1,0,1,0,1,1,0,0,'Per 100g: 32 kcal, Carbs 7.7g, Protein 0.7g, Fat 0.3g, Vitamin C 65% DV','Refrigerate unwashed. Wash just before eating. Best within 3 days.','Berry farms',NULL,'Fresh Strawberries — Fresh Box Price | FreshMart','Fragrant, ruby-red berries picked at dawn.','fresh strawberries, fresh seasonal fruits, wholesale, retail',541,'2026-07-15 14:33:53','2026-07-15 14:33:53'),(15,'Alphonso Mangoes','alphonso-mangoes',6,'Genuine Alphonso mangoes with silky, fiberless flesh and an intoxicating fragrance. Tree-ripened and individually cushioned for transit. A true seasonal delicacy.','The king of mangoes — saffron flesh, honeyed aroma.',8.99,NULL,'Box','[\"6-Piece Box\",\"12-Pi